{"title":"2015 UMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2015 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Utah_Math_Olympiad\" title=\"Utah Math Olympiad\">UMO</a></b> problems and solutions. The test was held on March 21, 2015. The first link contains the full set of test problems.  The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems\">Entire Test</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 UMO Answer Key\">Answer Key</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2015 UMO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 UMO Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.utmath.org/home\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UMO\" title=\"2014 UMO\">2014 UMO</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UMO\" title=\"2016 UMO\">2016 UMO</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Utah_Math_Olympiad\" title=\"Utah Math Olympiad\"> All UMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017134609\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 44/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 874/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 60/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion exp